# On-device AI. Only the DOWNLOADED payloads are ignored - ai/ai-worker.js, ai/src/ and
# ai/CONTRACT.md are hand-written source and must be committed, or a fresh clone has no worker
# and AI search cannot run at all. Note a blanket `ai/` cannot be undone with `!ai/src/**`:
# git never descends into an excluded directory, so the re-includes are silently ignored.
# (gitignore has no trailing comments - a pattern with one becomes a literal and matches nothing)
# ONNX Runtime Web ~28MB, and ONNX weights ~470MB, both from fetch-models.mjs:
ai/ort/
ai/models/
# scratch verification pages, not part of the app:
ai/diagnostics/

# Playwright MCP test artifacts
.playwright-mcp/
